assName":"space-y-3","children":[["$","li","Find the idea these sentences are circling",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-eng-navy-100 bg-eng-navy-50/50 p-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-xs font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":1}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-eng-navy-900","children":"Find the idea these sentences are circling"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"They are all about why midday slots fail. That is the claim — but no sentence states it, so the reader has to assemble it themselves."}]]}]]}]}],["$","li","Promote it to a topic sentence",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-eng-navy-100 bg-eng-navy-50/50 p-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-xs font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":2}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-eng-navy-900","children":"Promote it to a topic sentence"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"\"The clinic's midday appointments fail for a reason the schedule itself creates.\" Now every other sentence has a job."}]]}]]}]}],["$","li","Order the rest so each one earns the next",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-eng-navy-100 bg-eng-navy-50/50 p-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-xs font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":3}],"$L27"]}]}],"$L28"]}]]}],"$L29","$L2a"]}]]}]
24:["$","section",null,{"id":"guided","className":"scroll-mt-32 border-t border-eng-navy-200 pt-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-2 flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-sm font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":3}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-eng-teal-700","children":"Try It"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold text-eng-navy-900 sm:text-3xl","children":"Guided practice"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 max-w-[68ch] text-base leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-600","children":"Structured practice with support. Nothing here is graded."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-eng-navy-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"max-w-[68ch] text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"Work through these in order on paper or in the box below. Each one isolates a single move so you can feel the difference it makes."}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3","children":[["$","li","Take this topic: the bus route you use most. Write a sentence that names it. Then rewrite that sentence so it makes a claim someone could disagree with.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-xs font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":1}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"Take this topic: the bus route you use most. Write a sentence that names it. Then rewrite that sentence so it makes a claim someone could disagree with."}]]}],["$","li","Under your claim, list three specific details that support it. Specific means a number, a name, a time, or something you could point at.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-xs font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":2}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"Under your claim, list three specific details that support it. Specific means a number, a name, a time, or something you could point at."}]]}],["$","li","Turn the three details into sentences, and put a signal word at the front of the second and third. Choose the word by the relationship, not by which sounds best.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-xs font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":3}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"Turn the three details into sentences, and put a signal word at the front of the second and third. Choose the word by the relationship, not by which sounds best."}]]}],["$","li","Write a closing sentence that says something your topic sentence did not. If it just repeats the opening, cut it and write another.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-xs font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":4}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"Write a closing sentence that says something your topic sentence did not. If it just repeats the opening, cut it and write another."}]]}]]}],"$undefined"]}]]}]
25:["$","section",null,{"id":"independent","className":"scroll-mt-32 border-t border-eng-navy-200 pt-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-2 flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-sm font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":4}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-eng-teal-700","children":"Practice"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold text-eng-navy-900 sm:text-3xl","children":"Independent practice"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 max-w-[68ch] text-base leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-600","children":"On your own now. Your draft stays in this browser until you copy it somewhere."}]]}],["$","$L2b",null,{"writeIt":{"lab":0,"storageId":"tier2-paragraph","taskName":"One paragraph, one pattern","passageTitle":"Writing Lab — Tier 2","prompt":["Write one paragraph of six to eight sentences about a change you would make where you work, study, or live. Choose one pattern and commit to it: cause and effect, compare and contrast, sequence, or problem and solution.","Name your pattern in the first line of your submission, above the paragraph, so a reader knows what you were aiming at. Then write it well enough that they would have guessed correctly anyway."],"checklist":["I named my pattern above the paragraph","My first sentence makes a claim, not just a topic","I have at least three specific supporting details","Signal words mark each move, and each one matches the actual relationship","My closing sentence adds something rather than repeating the opening"],"frames":["The main problem with ______ is that ______.","For instance, ______. As a result, ______.","Whereas ______, ______ does the opposite."],"model":{"intro":"A compare-and-contrast paragraph. Notice that the two things are held against each other on the same points, in the same order, rather than described one after the other.","sentences":[{"text":"Taking the 12 bus to campus and taking the train are close on paper and not close at all in practice.","strand":"focus","note":"A claim with a built-in contrast, which is what a compare-and-contrast paragraph needs before it starts comparing."},{"text":"The bus is cheaper by about a dollar each way, and it stops two blocks from my door.","strand":"evidence","note":"Point one for the first option, with a number attached. Specific support, not a general impression."},{"text":"The train, in contrast, costs more and requires a ten-minute walk on each end.","strand":"evidence","note":"The same two points for the second option, in the same order. In contrast marks the turn."},{"text":"The difference that matters, though, is reliability.","strand":"organization","note":"A pivot sentence. It tells the reader the comparison is about to move to the point that decides it."},{"text":"The bus shares the road with rush-hour traffic and has arrived anywhere from four to twenty-five minutes late on the mornings I have tracked it.","strand":"evidence","note":"The deciding point, with a measured range rather than a complaint."},{"text":"The train runs on its own track and has never made me late.","strand":"organization","note":"The parallel half of the deciding point, kept short so the contrast lands."},{"text":"I take the train, and I pay the extra dollar for a morning I can plan around.","strand":"conventions","note":"A conclusion that follows from the comparison instead of restating it, in a complete, correctly punctuated sentence."}]},"brightspace":{"week":4,"dropbox":"WRITING PORTFOLIO — Writing Lab Practice"}}}]]}]
26:["$","section",null,{"id":"self-check","className":"scroll-mt-32 border-t border-eng-navy-200 pt-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-2 flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-sm font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":5}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-eng-teal-700","children":"Self-check"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold text-eng-navy-900 sm:text-3xl","children":"Check yourself"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 max-w-[68ch] text-base leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-600","children":"Not recorded, not a grade. Use it to decide whether to move on or go back."}]]}],["$","$L2c",null,{"items":["My topic sentence makes a claim someone could argue with","Every supporting detail is specific enough to point at","Each signal word matches the relationship it marks","A reader could name my pattern without being told","My last sentence adds something the first did not"]}]]}]
27:["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-eng-navy-900","children":"Order the rest so each one earns the next"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"Evidence (the unused slots), then explanation (why — the unpaid time off), then response (the evening block). Right now the response comes before the explanation, which is backwards."}]]}]
28:["$","li","Add the signal words that mark those moves",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-eng-navy-100 bg-eng-navy-50/50 p-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-navy-800 text-xs font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":4}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-eng-navy-900","children":"Add the signal words that mark those moves"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"\"Because\" for the cause, \"as a result\" for the response. Without them the reader is guessing at the relationships."}]]}]]}]}]
29:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"mb-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-eng-navy-500","children":"The revision"}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"rounded-xl border-l-4 border-eng-green-600 bg-eng-green-50 p-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-800","children":"The clinic's midday appointments fail for a reason the schedule itself creates. Slots scheduled around noon go unused far more often than any other hour. That happens because a midday appointment competes directly with a work shift most patients cannot leave without losing pay. As a result, the clinic moved several of those slots into an evening block."}]]}]
2a:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 rounded-xl bg-eng-navy-800 p-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-white","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-white/70","children":"Takeaway"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 block","children":"The sentences barely changed. What changed is that one of them now makes a claim, and the rest are ordered to support it."}]]}]
